OL,3,GNEWSAAre the autumns we remember
OL,4,Adisappearing?
OL,5,
OL,6,FAfter one of the hottest and driest
OL,7,Fsummers on record, experts warned some
OL,8,Ftrees had experienced a "false autumn"
OL,9,F- shedding leaves early to conserve
OL,10,Fwater rather than following the gradual
OL,11,Fseasonal process that produces vivid
OL,12,Fautumn colours.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
